# sk-1v3 -- W6-03-02 acceptance (fast form): a passive Allied player against
# three Brutal AIs on Arena must reach an outcome before game minute 40
# (36000 frames). The full scripted-player form is
# docs/gap/wave6/03-evidence/scripts/a1v3_brutal_arena.play. In a plain
# skirmish the AIs ally against the human (W6-a, FUN_00501460), so the
# expected end is LOST.
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click button "Customize Battle"
click map:xarena.map
click button "Use Map"
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Brutal Enemy"
click combo:ai2
click "pick:Brutal Enemy"
click combo:ai3
click "pick:Brutal Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
until 36000 world_outcome == LOST
until 900 outcome == LOST
end
